Description: Builds renderer-neutral map scenes that are drawn in their own
    coordinate reference system, with polar views as the first-class case.
    Data are carried as native 'GeoArrow' and grid descriptors. This is an
    early skeleton; the package name is a placeholder. Tiled Cloud Optimized
    GeoTIFFs are planned in R (levels, tile byte ranges and meshes projected
    to the view). Scenes are written to self-contained HTML pages drawn by a
    bundled 'deck.gl' renderer.
